ubstackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Fmz0!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbeb42e42-63dc-4ff8-890c-437d344b01e4_1280x720.jpeg 1456w\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Every day, Boeshi, a 20 year old college student, scrolls through social media, looking for new words and phrases. He tracks usage of words like huzz, soyboy, baddie, or mewing, not just to use in text messages with friends, but to invest in financially. </p>\n      <p>\n          <a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/p/the-hidden-financial-market-behind-gen-z-slang-coins-meme\">\n              Read more\n          </a>\n      </p>","author":"Taylor Lorenz","siteTitle":"usermag.co","siteHash":"95f273abc07d53f60c12a9877d5e701fc5d46103659afbdcd53f0429eec6280d","entryHash":"613f4856d0adce6e5b7569c1c01db84ac1f12f447c4674d2ae7146f1ef5c75b1","category":"Sites"}